This code initializes the pigpio library, opens the I2C device, and configures the ADS1115 ADC to read from channels AIN0 and AIN1. It reads the ADC values, converts them to pressure and temperature, and prints the results. It also controls a warning LED on GPIO17 based on the pressure value. The program handles errors and retries I2C reads up to 3 times. It cleans up resources on SIGINT.

