This code sets up a Raspberry Pi to monitor soil moisture using a Keyes KY-036 sensor and an MCP3008 ADC. It uses the pigpio library for SPI communication and logs the data to a file with timestamps. The program handles signals to terminate gracefully and includes error checking for initialization and SPI operations.

