This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up signal handlers for graceful shutdown, opens the SPI interface, and continuously samples the ADC. It calculates an exponential moving average of the readings and logs a peak when the raw value exceeds the EMA by 20%. Errors in initialization, SPI communication, and log file I/O are handled, and resources are released on exit.

