This code sets up a Raspberry Pi 5 to interface with an E18-D50NK IR proximity sensor using the libgpiod library. It polls the sensor every 100 ms and logs a timestamped event when an object is detected. The LED blinks for 100 ms when an object is detected. The program handles signals to ensure clean resource release on exit.

