This code sets up two TCRT5000 IR obstacle avoidance sensors on GPIO 17 and GPIO 27 using the pigpio library. It polls the sensors every 10 ms with a 50 ms debounce period and logs state transitions to a file. The program handles signals to ensure clean shutdown and checks all return values for errors.

