This code initializes the TDK InvenSense ICU-20201 ultrasonic time-of-flight sensor using the pigpio library on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It sets the sensor to continuous measurement mode, configures the range, and triggers measurements. The program continuously reads the distance in millimeters and logs it with a timestamp to a CSV file. It handles SPI communication errors, sensor initialization failures, and sensor-absent conditions gracefully. The program also installs signal handlers to ensure proper resource release and log file flushing on exit.

