This code sets up a daemon that monitors a water level sensor connected to GPIO 23 on a Raspberry Pi Zero W using the pigpio library. It logs alerts to a file and handles errors by attempting to reinitialize the GPIO configuration. The daemon runs until it receives a SIGINT or SIGTERM signal.

