This code sets up the Raspberry Pi to monitor two Hall-Effect sensors connected to GPIO 17 and GPIO 18 using the pigpio library. It includes a debounce mechanism, calculates RPM, logs sensor state changes to a CSV file, and handles signals gracefully.

