This code sets up a Raspberry Pi 5 to interface with a Keywish KY-033 4-Way Infrared Tracking Module using the libgpiod library. It polls the four sensor outputs every 100 ms, logs the sensor values to a timestamped CSV file, and handles graceful shutdown on SIGINT and SIGTERM.

