This code sets up the Raspberry Pi to detect seismic activity using two Omron D7E-2 tilt sensors. It uses the pigpio library to handle GPIO operations and register edge-triggered callbacks. The program logs each seismic event to a file and sets an alert pin high for 2 seconds when both sensors detect a tilt simultaneously for at least 500 milliseconds. It also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to clean up resources properly.

