This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up the GPIO pins for the TTP223 sensor and the relay, and configures a signal handler to gracefully terminate the program on SIGINT or SIGTERM. It continuously checks the state of the TTP223 sensor, toggling the relay state on each touch, with debouncing to prevent multiple toggles from a single touch. The program runs indefinitely until interrupted.

