This code implements a two-factor authentication system using the pigpio library on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It reads an RFID tag via SPI, checks it against a valid tag, waits for a button press, and unlocks two electromagnetic locks if both conditions are met. It logs all events to a file and handles signals for clean shutdown.

