This code provides a basic framework for interfacing with the AWR1642 mmWave radar sensor using the pigpio library for UART communication. It reads the UART data, synchronizes on the magic word, and processes the TLV payload to extract range and velocity data for detected objects. The data is written to a CSV file with timestamps. The program handles signals to ensure proper cleanup on exit. Note that the TLV parsing logic is simplified and may need to be adjusted based on the actual TLV format used by the AWR1642 sensor.

